ry><secondary>type of letter in word-formation</secondary></indexterm>  <in=
dexterm type=3D"general-imported"><primary>' symbol</primary><secondary>def=
inition (see also apostrophe)</secondary></indexterm>  <indexterm type=3D"g=
eneral-imported"><primary>apostrophe</primary><secondary>definition of</sec=
ondary></indexterm> The apostrophe represents a phoneme similar to a short,=
